{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10272060","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10272060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1027206001:0":{"text":"마법진이군요. 어느 위치에 뭘 넣어야 할지 파악해야 해요.","source_cn":"是法阵，看来我们得弄明白该在哪个位置上放什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC41EB8D3A0AC9EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1027206002:0":{"text":"근데 이 수수께끼는 대체 무슨 뜻일까요? 나무를 심으라는 건가요?","source_cn":"可是这谜题是什么意思？让我们种树吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC50F15C3D42971E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1027206003:0":{"text":"...해봐요! 마침 저한테 오크라가 있어요. 집에서 직접 재배한 거예요!","source_cn":"……来试试吧！刚好我身上带着六角葵，这可是我在家里亲手...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E52F2CF168B5E78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:月湖村民约兰达":{"text":"달빛호수 마을 주민 욜란다","source":"月湖村民约兰达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":3}}